      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm working on a piece about the recent energy and climate provisions in the Inflation Reduction Act. I need a quick breakdown of the main points of contention. Specifically, can you summarize the primary arguments from the proponents and the main concerns raised by the opposition, and give me an assessment of how valid those opposing concerns actually are in the current economic context?",
